---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How we ride"
  description="How this cycling blog thinks about touring, packing, café stops, and the next kilometre."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="site-shell path">
      <p class="eyebrow">How we ride</p>
      <h1 class="section-title">How we ride</h1>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Not a training plan. Habits from the road that keep a tour fun and a bike rolling.
      </p>

      <ol class="markers">
        <li>
          <h2>Check the bike, then go</h2>
          <p>
            Tyres, chain, brakes, a spare tube, a pump, lights if you might finish in the dark.
            Then leave. You do not need a perfect machine to start a tour.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h2>Pack light, pack twice</h2>
          <p>
            Handlebar bag, saddlebag, maybe a small frame bag. One spare layer. Tools you can use
            at the roadside. If it does not earn its grams, it stays home.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h2>Take the scenic road</h2>
          <p>
            The motorway is faster. The B-road, the pass, the farm lane. That is why we own a
            bike. A wrong turn is often a café you would have missed.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h2>Café kilometres count</h2>
          <p>
            Eat. Drink. Talk to the person with the pump. Rest days are part of touring. A window
            and a coffee are not wasted miles.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h2>Trains and ferries are fair</h2>
          <p>
            Put the bike in the luggage car. Skip the boring stretch. Ride the good bit. Travel is
            allowed to be mixed.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h2>Write the ride down</h2>
          <p>
            Three lines in a café notebook after you unclip: road, weather, what you saw. That is
            how a cycling blog stays honest.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/journal">Ride notes</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/stories">The rides</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .path {
    max-width: 42rem;
  }

  .markers {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: marker;
  }

  .markers li {
    position: relative;
    padding: 1.5rem 0 1.5rem 3.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(215, 224, 232, 0.12);
    counter-increment: marker;
  }

  .markers li::before {
    content: counter(marker, decimal-leading-zero);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 1.55rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  .markers h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.45rem;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .markers p {
    margin: 0;
    color: rgba(215, 224, 232, 0.78);
  }

  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }
</style>
